=== Piglins ===
[[Piglin]]s become hostile toward players who mine gold ore, even if the player is wearing golden [[armor]] or under the [[Invisibility]] effect. Piglins also run toward any gold ore item on the ground, and inspect it for 6 seconds {{in|java}} or 8 seconds {{in|bedrock}}<ref>{{bug|MCPE-99448||Piglins need 8 seconds to barter, while they only need 6 in java}}</ref> before putting it in their inventory.

